      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The annual Gimli Bluesfest hosts renowned blues musicians in the historic Gimli Park Pavilion each summer.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.travelmanitoba.com/places/must-see/gimli/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every day a Norse shield wall reenactment occurs beside an interactive village where blacksmithing, crafting, and sewing are demonstrated by the reenactors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
